      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elder unto the elect lady and her children, whom I love in truth; and not I only, but also all they that know the truth; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the truth’s sake which abideth in us, and it shall be with us for ever: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace, mercy, peace shall be with us, from God the Father, and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I rejoice greatly that I have found ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of thy children walking in truth, even as we received commandment from the Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote to thee a new commandment, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this is love, that we should walk after his commandments. This is the commandment, even as ye heard from the beginning, that ye should walk in it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For many deceivers are gone forth into the world, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " they that confess not that Jesus Christ cometh in the flesh. This is the deceiver and the antichrist. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look to yourselves, that ye lose not the things which we have wrought, but that ye receive a full reward. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whosoever goeth onward and abideth not in the teaching of Christ, hath not God: he that abideth in the teaching, the same hath both the Father and the Son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any one cometh unto you, and bringeth not this teaching, receive him not into ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " house, and give him no greeting: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for he that giveth him greeting partaketh in his evil works.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Having many things to write unto you, I would not ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with paper and ink: but I hope to come unto you, and to speak face to face, that your joy may be made full. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The children of thine elect sister salute thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
